{
  "name": "VELORA — Events (emails + articles)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VELORA events receiver\nReceives signed events from VELORA (`N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Open **Settings** and fill in VELORA_URL, WEBHOOK_SECRET (= N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET) and FROM_EMAIL.\n2. Credentials: **VELORA API** (Header Auth: `Authorization` / `Bearer <N8N_API_KEY>`), **OpenAI**, **SMTP**.\n3. Self-hosted n8n: set `NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto` (signature check).\n4. Activate, copy the **Production URL** of \"Velora event\" into `N8N_WEBHOOK_URL`.\n\nBad signatures get 401. Duplicate event ids are answered 200 and skipped.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "velora-0124-0000-4000-8000-000000000124",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
